<title>FINLAND: NOKIA ADS OPENS AT $56-3/4 ON WALL STREET.</title>
<headline>NOKIA ADS OPENS AT $56-3/4 ON WALL STREET.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1996-12-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nokia Oy's A share ADR opened $0-1/2 lower at $56-3/4 in New York on Thursday. The price corresponds to about 264.03 markka.</p>
<p>--- Helsinki newsroom +358-9-680 50 240</p>
</text>
